  "brief_text": "I need to decide how best to split my attention as the main founder working on Olumi at the moment.\nI urgently need to secure funding: both fast-paced angel and, eventually, a larger fund of at least 1.3 million.\nI need to complete the PoC. I have AI working on it, so I don't need to be on it all of the time, but the more time I spend testing and improving it, the better it is.\nI need to put job specs out for the resource we need.\n\nI need to determine what I should prioritise and how I should spend my time across these.\n\nOnce funding is secured, then that changes this question completely. Securing funding is an outcome that would result in a new decision, not influence this decision.",
